title: mnml at a glance
flow: The file tree opens a file, the palette puts an agent session beside the editor, a shell opens below it, the Jira pane is one tab away, and the editor takes the keys back.
# Setup: the Jira integration installed off camera (the offline fake).
run integrations.show_in_dev
until INTEGRATIONS
until "Jira Work" 4000
find-click "Jira Work"
key i
until "installed jira_work" 15000
wait 4500
run integrations.open_as_tab
reset
record
wait 1000
# the tree: walk down to src/util.zig and open it
keys @300 down down down down
key enter
until "pub fn sum"
wait 1200
# the palette: an agent session in the right half
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 250
slowtype "claude right" 60
wait 500
key enter
until "agent session" 4000
wait 2200
# a shell below the agent
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 250
slowtype "shell bottom" 60
wait 400
key enter
until "tour %" 4000
wait 300
slowtype "git log --oneline\n" 45
until "Start the tour project" 3000
wait 1800
poster
# Jira, one tab away
run jira_work.open
until "JIRA WORK" 15000
heal "fetch failed" r "JIRA WORK (3)"
wait 2500
# back to the editor
run view.focus_left
wait 400
keys @120 down down down down down down down down
wait 1500
